# Native projects — CNG (Continuous Native Generation).
#
# android/ and ios/ are GENERATED from app.json + config plugins by
# `npx expo prebuild`. They are disposable build artefacts, not source, so the
# whole directory is ignored rather than just its build output.
#
# Consequences, so nobody is surprised:
#   • NEVER hand-edit anything under android/ or ios/ — the next prebuild
#     silently discards it. Native changes go in app.json or a config plugin.
#   • A dependency without an Expo config plugin needs a small local plugin
#     written for it, not a native edit.
#
# Reversing this (going "bare" — committing native dirs) is a team decision,
# not a per-person one: it trades automatic SDK upgrades for native merge
# conflicts. Discuss before flipping it.
/android
/ios
*.hprof

.DS_Store

